Rule 2 (broadcasting compatibility for input tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ndim(v_2) = 0 then true else ∀i ∈ [0, if ndim(v_1) ≤ ndim(v_2) then ndim(v_1) - 1 else ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1 - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1 - i) = 1
>>
Rule 4 (broadcast compatibility for trailing dimensions of input tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [1, if ndim(v_1) < ndim(v_2) then ndim(v_1) else ndim(v_2)] : shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - i) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - i)
>>
Rule 6 (input tensors must have compatible trailing dimensions for broadcasting)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 0 ∨ ndim(v_2) = 0 then true else shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = 1
